================================================================== 600 1451   10
The Livermore Evaluated Atomic Data Library (EADL) in the          600 1451   11
ENDF-6 Format. Translated from the Livermore ENDL format           600 1451   12
to the ENDF-6 Format by Bob MacFarlane (Los Alamos).               600 1451   13
